"club-opener-desc":"The Opener is designed for all golfers to open the game and to keep them on the fairway.",
"club-mover-desc":"As the name suggests,the Mover helps you to move forward in the game.<br class=\"tablet-desktop-br\">Also perfect for great tee shots.",
"club-riser-desc":"When you’re in a position to attack the green,the focus shifts to the short game<br class=\"tablet-desktop-br\">and distance gives way to precision.",
"club-pitcher-desc":"Spin is crucial in short game. Now you’re targeting the pin,<br class=\"tablet-desktop-br\">the Pitcher helps you to land the ball close to the flag.",
"club-maker-desc":"The Maker helps you keep your cool during the difficult final stage<br class=\"tablet-desktop-br\">so you can head to the next hole full of confidence.",
"club-saver-desc":"It’s all in the name:the Saver is there to get you<br class=\"tablet-desktop-br\">out of trouble in the short game.",
"club-butler-desc":"The Butler is the most versatile companion.<br class=\"tablet-desktop-br\">The wide sole helps to glide through any ground conditions.",
