"next-read-innovation-title":"Innovation:Engineered to Perform",
"next-read-innovation-desc":"Developed and produced in Switzerland,Carbonics Technology is the result of over a decade of engineering — and the foundation of everything we build. By liberating 70% of the clubhead's total weight,we place it exactly where it benefits you most.",
"next-read-material-title":"Material:With Carbon,golf becomes simpler",
"next-read-material-desc":"A groundbreaking innovation born from expertise. With over 25 years of experience,Golfyr founder Roger Stadler recognized the untapped potential of carbon for golf. Together with carbon expert Daniel Hüsler,he developed Carbonics Technology — a revolutionary manufacturing process.",
"next-read-production-title":"Production:Engineered with Swiss Precision",
"next-read-production-desc":"At Golfyr,the development of our clubs represents an unmatched synergy of innovation and craftsmanship. Through our partnership with renowned Carbon Technology specialist Daniel Hüsler and his company adultimum,we are committed to creating golf clubs that stand out.",
"next-read-tech-title":"Carbonics:Rethink Golf with Carbon Clubs",
"next-read-tech-desc":"Learn how Carbonics Technology liberates weight and enhances performance. Discover our patented hollow-body design,optimized weight distribution,and why carbon clubs represent the biggest leap in golf club engineering in a generation.",
