"experience-shop-filter-off":"Off-Course",
"experience-shop-filter-on":"On-Course",
"experience-shop-filter-pros":"Pros/Teachers",
"experience-shop-pros-label":"Teaching Pros",
"experience-shop-website":"Website",
"experience-shop-load-more":"Load more",
"about-hero-pre":"About us",
"about-hero-title":"Welcome to<br>our World",
"about-hero-btn":"Get to know us",
"about-scroll-cta":"Discover more",
"about-intro-body":"Based in Switzerland,we are redefining the way golf is played. We call it 7&gt;14:an optimized golf experience using only seven essential SWISS MADE carbon clubs on the course.",
"about-values-title":"Our Values",
"about-values-subtitle":"Our approach makes golf simpler,more accessible,and more enjoyable—bringing back the pure joy of the game. It’s time to rethink golf.",
"about-value-joy-title":"Joy",
"about-value-joy-desc":"Golf is meant to be fun. We focus on effortless play and pure enjoyment.",
"about-value-simplicity-title":"Simplicity",
"about-value-simplicity-desc":"Less complexity,more game. Our clubs streamline the experience,making golf easier and more intuitive.",
"about-value-quality-title":"Quality",
"about-value-quality-desc":"Precision and reliability,perfected through Swiss Engineering.",
"about-value-technology-title":"Technology",
"about-value-technology-desc":"With Carbonics Technology,we’re redefining club design and performance.",
"about-value-performance-title":"Performance",
"about-value-performance-desc":"Maximum efficiency and better results for a sustainably optimized game.",
"about-timeline-title":"Explore our story",
"about-timeline-m1-title":"An innovator with a vision",
"about-timeline-m1-desc":"The vision of “Rethink Golf” was born,and our founder,Roger Stadler,crafted his first carbon club by hand.",
"about-timeline-m2-title":"Proof of Idea",
"about-timeline-m2-desc":"We faced the first important question:Is the idea technologically feasible? Roger Stadler reached out to Daniel Hüsler,CEO of adultimum ag and our Head of Technology.",
"about-timeline-m3-title":"Proof of Concept",
"about-timeline-m3-desc":"The first prototypes were developed under the leadership of Daniel Hüsler – and the vision was starting to take shape.",
"about-timeline-m4-title":"Club development",
"about-timeline-m4-desc":"In close collaboration between Creative Director Alfredo Häberli and Head of Technology Daniel Hüsler,the club began to take shape.",
"about-timeline-m5-title":"Proof of Market Fit",
"about-timeline-m5-desc":"We analyzed player habits and market trends,asking golfers:Do you really need 14 clubs,or could you play with fewer? This sparked the idea for the #sevenclubgame.",
"about-timeline-m6-title":"Proof of Concept #sevenclubgame",
"about-timeline-m6-desc":"After extensive testing and countless challenges,we confirmed that seven clubs were all it takes. The #sevenclubgame was officially born,introducing a revolutionary way to play golf.",
"about-timeline-m7-title":"Groove Days & Field Tests",
"about-timeline-m7-desc":"In Mallorca,our “Groove Days” confirmed that the engineering theory worked on the course. Afterward,golfers of all handicaps conducted extensive field tests to validate and refine the clubs.",
"about-timeline-m8-title":"Performance & Durability Testing",
"about-timeline-m8-desc":"We conducted rigorous endurance tests with high-pressure cannons to ensure the durability of our clubs. In parallel,external performance tests confirmed that the Maker outperforms other top-tier putter.",
"about-timeline-m9-title":"Robot Test in San Diego",
"about-timeline-m9-desc":"At San Diego’s “Golf Laboratories”,our clubs were tested against top competitors,confirming superior accuracy and forgiveness.",
"about-timeline-m10-title":"Certified for Tournament Play",
"about-timeline-m10-desc":"Our carbon putter,the Maker,has been ruled as conforming to the official Rules of Golf,making it eligible for use in competitive play worldwide.",
"about-timeline-m11-title":"Market Launch of the Maker",
"about-timeline-m11-desc":"The Maker was ready for launch. We unveiled our carbon putter to the public and press during our Ryder Cup public viewing event in Zürich.",
"about-timeline-m12-title":"The Maker at LIV Golf",
"about-timeline-m12-desc":"Our 1of7 was seen at LIV Golf in the hands of an international Pro – the Maker is now officially tournament-approved.",
"about-timeline-m13-title":"Full Set Unveiled:Field Tests Begin",
"about-timeline-m13-desc":"In the scenic setting of Bad Ragaz,our Pre-Order Event brought early adopters together to test the complete Golfyr set on the course,marking a major step from innovation to performance.",
"about-timeline-continue":"Our story continues...",
"about-visionaries-text":"Seven clubs instead of 14 means more focus and clarity. Enjoy the course without the burden of excessive gear – and experience the game you truly love,developed by four visionary minds.",
"about-roger-quote":"“Golf is a fascinating game which is best played with a light heart,good friends and continuous improvement.”",
"about-roger-name":"Roger Stadler",
"about-roger-role":"FOUNDER/PRESIDENT OF THE BOARD",
"about-daniel-quote":"“Our hard work pays off and the statistics prove it:You will land on the fairway more often and with a lot more fun.”",
"about-daniel-name":"Daniel Hüsler",
"about-daniel-role":"HEAD OF TECHNOLOGY",
"about-alfredo-quote":"“You must ask the right questions to create something outstanding. This time it was:What needs to be reduced?”",
"about-alfredo-name":"Alfredo Häberli",
"about-alfredo-role":"CREATIVE DIRECTOR",
"about-olivier-quote":"“It’s finally time to rethink golf and enabling a more playful approach to the game as originally intended. When you’re on the course with a Golfyr set the tale will tell itself.”",
"about-olivier-name":"Olivier Widrig",
"about-olivier-role":"HEAD OF GOLF",
"about-stats-n1-val":"300’000",
"about-stats-n1-text":"shots on the golf club face at speeds of up to 195 km/h.",
"about-stats-n2-val":"200",
"about-stats-n2-text":"manufacturing steps to produce the finished golf club.",
"about-stats-n3-val":"7",
"about-stats-n3-text":"years to create the full carbon clubs with their unique performance profile.",
